# STIG CNTR-K8-000290: User-managed resources must be created in dedicated namespac
# STIG ID: V-242383 (HIGH)

META
    esp_id `k8s-cntr-k8-000290-no-user-pods-default-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `kubernetes`
    criticality `critical`

    title `STIG CNTR-K8-000290: User-managed resources must be created in dedicated namespaces.`
    description `User-managed resources must be created in dedicated namespaces.`
    author `example-security`
    tags `kubernetes,stig,disa-stig`

    control_mapping `DISA-STIG:CNTR-K8-000290,NIST-800-53:CM-6`
    control_objective `CM-6`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `system-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `Kubernetes:cluster:k8s-hardening`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `1`
    recommendation `Review and remediate per DISA STIG guidance for CNTR-K8-000290.`

    component_id `comp-k8s-cluster`

    impl_CM_6 `This control is validated by checking the required Kubernetes configuration against the DISA STIG baseline.`

META_END

DEF
    OBJECT resource_check
        kind `Pod`
        namespace `default`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE resource_state
         count int = 0
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN k8s_resource
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF resource_state
            OBJECT_REF resource_check
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
